<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 308 0 R
/E (TEDGuideAI leverages a robust NLP pipeline to understand and process TED Talk content at scale. Text preprocessing involves cleaning raw transcripts through tokenization, stopword removal, stemming, and lemmatization to prepare data for analysis. TF-IDF vectorization and word embeddings \(Word2Vec, GloVe\) capture semantic relationships between talks and user preferences. Sentiment analysis evaluates the emotional tone of content, enabling mood-aware recommendations. Topic modeling using Latent Dirichlet Allocation \(LDA\) discovers hidden thematic structures across thousands of TED Talk transcripts.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
